  "title": "2026-07-25-eval-160035 · llm-inference-gateway",
  "description": "# LLM inference gateway\n\nA capability-tier request flows left to right through identity stamping, tenant admission, deadline-aware queuing, cache lookup, prompt policy, and tier-aware routing into hosted or self-hosted capacity. The attempts panel shows pre-token failure classification, retryable fallback with the same idempotency key, and the no-silent-retry boundary once streaming starts. Circuit breakers and spend controls protect capacity; metering feeds billing and redacted audit storage. Dashed pink evaluation traffic is isolated from the client response.",
  "mode": "diagram",
